@startuml
title UML - immutable incoming and return reconciliation, suspense and ownership
actor "Current Finance adjuster" as maker
participant "Finance BFF / API" as api
participant "Frozen parent report" as report
participant "Independent credit file provider" as provider
participant "Core read-only credit port" as core
participant "Payments read-only receipt port" as payments
database "Finance credit observations" as store
participant "Recovery worker" as worker
participant "Controls Finance cases" as cases
maker -> api : capture(reportId, fileId, actor/client/key)
api -> api : current role / REVIEW + CSRF / origin
api -> store : exact prior request lookup
alt saved original request
 store --> api : original artifact and immutable digest
else new observation
 api -> report : verify sealed journal / GL archives
 report --> api : original membership, source clock and digest
 api -> provider : signed CREDIT_RECONCILIATION_V1 + nonce
 provider --> api : signed request binding + independent immutable file
 api -> api : bounds / authentication / period checks
 api -> core : discover movement + suspense / allocation / original receipts
 core --> api : repeatable-read facts + lifetime returned principal + clock
 api -> payments : capture signed receipt / identity / workflow
 payments --> api : separate repeatable-read source and clock
 api -> core : confirm explicit workflow and file movement identities
 core --> api : committed native facts, original finality and cap
 loop every bank / provider / journal identity in union
  api -> api : verify movement signature / scope / amount / value date
  api -> api : return original settlement / payer / cumulative principal cap
  api -> api : exact suspense and allocation journal legs / original links
  api -> api : independent file claims + captured GL / actual booking dates
 end
 api -> store : lock actor/client/key; recheck authority
 api -> store : commit summary / private proofs / stable rows / issues + audit
end
api --> maker : saved scope / controls / completeness / digest
worker -> store : next 50 unowned issues, wrapping cursor
loop continue after failed scope
 worker -> cases : stable issue origin, Finance queue
 cases --> worker : original case ID after lost ACK
 worker -> store : one-time case link
end
note over api,core
MATCHED requires native customer allocation plus exact captured evidence.
Funds in suspense remain PARTIAL and owned.
A provider over-cap return claim cannot become bank money.
Separate source clocks; no global atomic snapshot claim.
end note
maker -> api : reopen / stable ordinal pages
api -> api : verify hashes, archived HMAC, parent and membership
api --> maker : safe retained lineage + current case links
@enduml
